@revert_cuts
title: Revert Healthcare spending cuts
view-if: health_cuts > 0
subtitle: \[-1 budget\]
choose-if: government_budget > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
on-arrival: {!
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "health_cuts", undefined, true);
    Q.health_cuts -= 1;
    Q.government_budget -= 1
!}

Austerity measures affecting the Catalan public health system have been reversed, but years of spending cuts have left a mark in the system. Significant effort is still left to be done to recover and improve it.
